{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Paranormal Survey is a &quot;Spot The Difference&quot; style game, look out for moving objects, objects growing in size, paintings may change, and certain other spooky events may occur.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have been hired to oversee the reporting and removal of a paranormal presence in the Parker Mansion and the Old Cathedral. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your job is to find all of the anomalies and simply click them to report them, be careful though, if you reach 10 active anomalies its game over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Realistic graphics</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 levels to observe and explore (More coming soon!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 Difficulty settings (Easy, Medium, Hard)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tutorials to help ease the learning experience</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3606520?t=1742878118","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3606520?t=1742878118","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606520/3ab820e1f63262e7c481c566e207d1a59c39dac6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742878118","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606520/3ab820e1f63262e7c481c566e207d1a59c39dac6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742878118","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Paranormal Survey is a &quot;Spot The Difference&quot; style game, look out for moving objects, objects growing in size, paintings may change, and certain other spooky events may occur.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have been hired to oversee the reporting and removal of a paranormal presence in the Parker Mansion and the Old Cathedral. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your job is to find all of the anomalies and simply click them to report them, be careful though, if you reach 10 active anomalies its game over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Realistic graphics</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 levels to observe and explore (More coming soon!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 Difficulty settings (Easy, Medium, Hard)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tutorials to help ease the learning experience</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Panda Siege"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606520/fdf8ac9712a066e58b4a3108a24367dd014327ee/header.jpg?t=1742878118","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257116158,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116158/movie480.mp4?t=1742878116","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116158/movie_max.mp4?t=1742878116"},"name":"Teaser Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257116158/e73af8ba0253d2322bdf99bcd313b9d2143b267b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1742878116","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116158/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1742878116","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116158/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1742878116"}}],"name":"Paranormal Survey","package_gr